{"nodes":[{"id":"_agents_skills_prisma_mongodb_upgrade_references_decision_stay_or_migrate_prisma_next","label":"Prisma Next","file_type":"concept","source_file":"/Users/sadegh/Elajgar/.agents/skills/prisma-mongodb-upgrade/references/decision-stay-or-migrate.md","source_location":null,"source_url":null,"captured_at":null,"author":null,"contributor":null,"rationale":"Successor ORM for MongoDB projects; MongoDB support is Early Access (GA planned after Postgres); deep implementation with ORM, typed aggregation-pipeline builder, raw lane, driver over official mongodb package; contract-driven migrations; pre-1.0 minors can carry breaking changes with published upgrade recipes."},{"id":"_agents_skills_prisma_mongodb_upgrade_references_decision_stay_or_migrate_prisma_v6","label":"Prisma v6 (classic ORM)","file_type":"concept","source_file":"/Users/sadegh/Elajgar/.agents/skills/prisma-mongodb-upgrade/references/decision-stay-or-migrate.md","source_location":null,"source_url":null,"captured_at":null,"author":null,"contributor":null,"rationale":"Last classic-ORM major supporting MongoDB; fully supports MongoDB including transactions on replica sets; no Prisma Migrate; workflow is `db push`."},{"id":"_agents_skills_prisma_mongodb_upgrade_references_decision_stay_or_migrate_prisma_v7","label":"Prisma 7","file_type":"concept","source_file":"/Users/sadegh/Elajgar/.agents/skills/prisma-mongodb-upgrade/references/decision-stay-or-migrate.md","source_location":null,"source_url":null,"captured_at":null,"author":null,"contributor":null,"rationale":"No MongoDB connector; v7 upgrade is impossible for MongoDB projects; advising it or silently rewriting onto SQL are serious failure modes."},{"id":"_agents_skills_prisma_mongodb_upgrade_references_decision_stay_or_migrate_mongodb_8_0_floor","label":"MongoDB 8.0 floor","file_type":"rationale","source_file":"/Users/sadegh/Elajgar/.agents/skills/prisma-mongodb-upgrade/references/decision-stay-or-migrate.md","source_location":null,"source_url":null,"captured_at":null,"author":null,"contributor":null,"rationale":"Prisma Next requires MongoDB 8.0+; v6 tolerated older servers; server version must be checked before planning migration."},{"id":"_agents_skills_prisma_mongodb_upgrade_references_decision_stay_or_migrate_mongodb_driver_v7_peer","label":"mongodb@^7 peer dependency","file_type":"rationale","source_file":"/Users/sadegh/Elajgar/.agents/skills/prisma-mongodb-upgrade/references/decision-stay-or-migrate.md","source_location":null,"source_url":null,"captured_at":null,"author":null,"contributor":null,"rationale":"MongoDB driver is a user-supplied peer dependency, directly accessible; floor is `mongodb@^7`."},{"id":"_agents_skills_prisma_mongodb_upgrade_references_decision_stay_or_migrate_stay_on_v6_hygiene","label":"Stay on v6 hygiene","file_type":"rationale","source_file":"/Users/sadegh/Elajgar/.agents/skills/prisma-mongodb-upgrade/references/decision-stay-or-migrate.md","source_location":null,"source_url":null,"captured_at":null,"author":null,"contributor":null,"rationale":"Staying is a decision, not default-by-neglect: pin prisma/@prisma/client to latest 6.x, watch release notes and security advisories, keep classic setup (`url = env(\"DATABASE_URL\")`, `db push`, no SQL driver adapters), re-evaluate at GA or when EA blockers resolve."},{"id":"_agents_skills_prisma_mongodb_upgrade_references_decision_stay_or_migrate_db_transaction_facade_missing","label":"Next Mongo db.transaction facade missing","file_type":"rationale","source_file":"/Users/sadegh/Elajgar/.agents/skills/prisma-mongodb-upgrade/references/decision-stay-or-migrate.md","source_location":null,"source_url":null,"captured_at":null,"author":null,"contributor":null,"rationale":"The Mongo client facade does not wrap `db.transaction(...)` yet; multi-document atomicity is done through the MongoDB driver's session API (`client.startSession()` / `session.withTransaction(...)`); a facade wrapper is expected."},{"id":"_agents_skills_prisma_mongodb_upgrade_references_decision_stay_or_migrate_replica_set_transaction_requirement","label":"v6 replica set transaction requirement","file_type":"rationale","source_file":"/Users/sadegh/Elajgar/.agents/skills/prisma-mongodb-upgrade/references/decision-stay-or-migrate.md","source_location":null,"source_url":null,"captured_at":null,"author":null,"contributor":null,"rationale":"v6 MongoDB transactions require a replica set; MongoDB only allows starting a transaction on a replica set."},{"id":"_agents_skills_prisma_mongodb_upgrade_references_decision_stay_or_migrate_upgrade_recipes_0_11_to_0_12","label":"Prisma Next upgrade recipes","file_type":"rationale","source_file":"/Users/sadegh/Elajgar/.agents/skills/prisma-mongodb-upgrade/references/decision-stay-or-migrate.md","source_location":null,"source_url":null,"captured_at":null,"author":null,"contributor":null,"rationale":"Pre-1.0 minors can carry breaking changes; Next publishes versioned upgrade recipes between minors (e.g. 0.11→0.12 changed Mongo validator emission and made `mongodb` a user-supplied peer dependency); someone must run them."},{"id":"_agents_skills_prisma_mongodb_upgrade_references_decision_stay_or_migrate_prisma_next_repository","label":"Prisma Next repository","file_type":"concept","source_file":"/Users/sadegh/Elajgar/.agents/skills/prisma-mongodb-upgrade/references/decision-stay-or-migrate.md","source_location":null,"source_url":"https://github.com/prisma/prisma-next","captured_at":null,"author":null,"contributor":null,"rationale":"Authoritative source for Prisma Next; verified @ a2791c5dd59d579b4b3052942ae7f8fe5e2ee852; status confirmed by Prisma team 2026-07."},{"id":"_agents_skills_prisma_mongodb_upgrade_references_decision_stay_or_migrate_v6_mongodb_docs","label":"Prisma v6 MongoDB documentation","file_type":"concept","source_file":"/Users/sadegh/Elajgar/.agents/skills/prisma-mongodb-upgrade/references/decision-stay-or-migrate.md","source_location":null,"source_url":"https://www.prisma.io/docs/orm/overview/databases/mongodb","captured_at":null,"author":null,"contributor":null,"rationale":"Reference for v6 MongoDB support, replica-set transactions, and lack of Prisma Migrate."},{"id":"_agents_skills_prisma_mongodb_upgrade_references_migrations_mapping_v6_db_push","label":"v6 db push workflow","file_type":"rationale","source_file":"/Users/sadegh/Elajgar/.agents/skills/prisma-mongodb-upgrade/references/migrations-mapping.md","source_location":null,"source_url":null,"captured_at":null,"author":null,"contributor":null,"rationale":"v6 MongoDB has no Prisma Migrate; workflow is `prisma db push` to sync indexes and unique constraints, with no migration history on disk."},{"id":"_agents_skills_prisma_mongodb_upgrade_references_migrations_mapping_prisma_next_migration_lifecycle","label":"Prisma Next migration lifecycle","file_type":"rationale","source_file":"/Users/sadegh/Elajgar/.agents/skills/prisma-mongodb-upgrade/references/migrations-mapping.md","source_location":null,"source_url":null,"captured_at":null,"author":null,"contributor":null,"rationale":"Contract emit → diff → plan (content-hashed migration package) → migrate (apply in graph order) → verify (live schema vs destination contract) → sign (advance marker after verify pass)."},{"id":"_agents_skills_prisma_mongodb_upgrade_references_migrations_mapping_mongodb_migration_ops","label":"Mongo migration operations","file_type":"rationale","source_file":"/Users/sadegh/Elajgar/.agents/skills/prisma-mongodb-upgrade/references/migrations-mapping.md","source_location":null,"source_url":null,"captured_at":null,"author":null,"contributor":null,"rationale":"Dedicated factories: createCollection, dropCollection, validatedCollection, setValidation, createIndex, dropIndex, collMod, dataTransform for data backfills."},{"id":"_agents_skills_prisma_mongodb_upgrade_references_migrations_mapping_prisma_migrations_collection","label":"_prisma_migrations collection","file_type":"rationale","source_file":"/Users/sadegh/Elajgar/.agents/skills/prisma-mongodb-upgrade/references/migrations-mapping.md","source_location":null,"source_url":null,"captured_at":null,"author":null,"contributor":null,"rationale":"Next records migration state in a document in the `_prisma_migrations` collection (per space); same collection name family v6 users know from SQL, repurposed for Mongo state."},{"id":"_agents_skills_prisma_mongodb_upgrade_references_migrations_mapping_ddl_not_transactional_on_mongodb","label":"DDL not transactional on MongoDB","file_type":"rationale","source_file":"/Users/sadegh/Elajgar/.agents/skills/prisma-mongodb-upgrade/references/migrations-mapping.md","source_location":null,"source_url":null,"captured_at":null,"author":null,"contributor":null,"rationale":"DDL is not transactional on Mongo; runner applies operations, verifies live schema against destination contract, advances marker only on verify pass — interrupted runs are resumable rather than atomic."},{"id":"_agents_skills_prisma_mongodb_upgrade_references_migrations_mapping_db_update_push_style","label":"db update push-style alternative","file_type":"rationale","source_file":"/Users/sadegh/Elajgar/.agents/skills/prisma-mongodb-upgrade/references/migrations-mapping.md","source_location":null,"source_url":null,"captured_at":null,"author":null,"contributor":null,"rationale":"`db update` diffs the live database against the contract and applies directly without writing a migration directory — closest analogue to v6 `db push`, at the cost of no history; reserve for local prototyping."},{"id":"_agents_skills_prisma_mongodb_upgrade_references_migrations_mapping_json_schema_validators_next","label":"Next closed $jsonSchema validators","file_type":"rationale","source_file":"/Users/sadegh/Elajgar/.agents/skills/prisma-mongodb-upgrade/references/migrations-mapping.md","source_location":null,"source_url":null,"captured_at":null,"author":null,"contributor":null,"rationale":"Next emits closed `$jsonSchema` validators by default since 0.12; collections gain schema enforcement v6 never applied."},{"id":"_agents_skills_prisma_mongodb_upgrade_references_client_api_mapping_v6_client_api","label":"Prisma v6 Client API","file_type":"concept","source_file":"/Users/sadegh/Elajgar/.agents/skills/prisma-mongodb-upgrade/references/client-api-mapping.md","source_location":null,"source_url":null,"captured_at":null,"author":null,"contributor":null,"rationale":"Names map to Prisma Next but parity does not; none of v6 MongoDB raw methods exist under old names; aggregation moved to a different lane; transactions go through the driver rather than a facade wrapper."},{"id":"_agents_skills_prisma_mongodb_upgrade_references_client_api_mapping_next_orm_lane","label":"Prisma Next ORM lane","file_type":"concept","source_file":"/Users/sadegh/Elajgar/.agents/skills/prisma-mongodb-upgrade/references/client-api-mapping.md","source_location":null,"source_url":null,"captured_at":null,"author":null,"contributor":null,"rationale":"Fluent ORM lane; storage-name keys (`db.orm.<collection>`); e.g. `prisma.user.findMany(...)` → `db.orm.users.where(...).all()`."},{"id":"_agents_skills_prisma_mongodb_upgrade_references_client_api_mapping_mongo_raw_lane","label":"Prisma Next mongoRaw lane","file_type":"concept","source_file":"/Users/sadegh/Elajgar/.agents/skills/prisma-mongodb-upgrade/references/client-api-mapping.md","source_location":null,"source_url":null,"captured_at":null,"author":null,"contributor":null,"rationale":"Raw lane is `mongoRaw(...)` → raw collection with `aggregate`, `insertOne/Many`, `updateOne/Many`, `deleteOne/Many`, `findOneAndUpdate/Delete`; for arbitrary database commands use the underlying `mongodb` driver directly."},{"id":"_agents_skills_prisma_mongodb_upgrade_references_client_api_mapping_typed_aggregation_pipeline_builder","label":"Typed aggregation-pipeline builder","file_type":"concept","source_file":"/Users/sadegh/Elajgar/.agents/skills/prisma-mongodb-upgrade/references/client-api-mapping.md","source_location":null,"source_url":null,"captured_at":null,"author":null,"contributor":null,"rationale":"Replaces v6 `aggregate()`/`groupBy()`; e.g. `db.query.from(...).match(...).group(...).build()`."},{"id":"_agents_skills_prisma_mongodb_upgrade_references_client_api_mapping_mongodb_driver_sessions","label":"MongoDB driver sessions","file_type":"concept","source_file":"/Users/sadegh/Elajgar/.agents/skills/prisma-mongodb-upgrade/references/client-api-mapping.md","source_location":null,"source_url":null,"captured_at":null,"author":null,"contributor":null,"rationale":"Multi-document atomicity via driver sessions (`client.startSession()` / `session.withTransaction(...)`) on a replica set; the facade does not wrap `db.transaction(...)` yet."},{"id":"_agents_skills_prisma_mongodb_upgrade_references_client_api_mapping_connect_close_lane","label":"connect/close client lifecycle","file_type":"concept","source_file":"/Users/sadegh/Elajgar/.agents/skills/prisma-mongodb-upgrade/references/client-api-mapping.md","source_location":null,"source_url":null,"captured_at":null,"author":null,"contributor":null,"rationale":"v6 `$connect`/`$disconnect` → `connect()`/`close()` on the Mongo facade client."},{"id":"_agents_skills_prisma_mongodb_upgrade_references_verify_cutover_checklist_no_data_moves_ground_rule","label":"No data moves ground rule","file_type":"rationale","source_file":"/Users/sadegh/Elajgar/.agents/skills/prisma-mongodb-upgrade/references/verify-cutover-checklist.md","source_location":null,"source_url":null,"captured_at":null,"author":null,"contributor":null,"rationale":"v6→Next migration is a client and workflow migration against the same MongoDB database; no data export/import; introducing one or pointing the new stack at a fresh database turns a code migration into an outage."},{"id":"_agents_skills_prisma_mongodb_upgrade_references_verify_cutover_checklist_same_database_verified","label":"Same database verified","file_type":"rationale","source_file":"/Users/sadegh/Elajgar/.agents/skills/prisma-mongodb-upgrade/references/verify-cutover-checklist.md","source_location":null,"source_url":null,"captured_at":null,"author":null,"contributor":null,"rationale":"Checklist item 1: Next config points at the same connection string/database name the v6 app uses (minus v6-specific URL parameters the `mongodb@^7` driver rejects)."},{"id":"_agents_skills_prisma_mongodb_upgrade_references_verify_cutover_checklist_contract_round_trip","label":"Contract round-trip on a copy","file_type":"rationale","source_file":"/Users/sadegh/Elajgar/.agents/skills/prisma-mongodb-upgrade/references/verify-cutover-checklist.md","source_location":null,"source_url":null,"captured_at":null,"author":null,"contributor":null,"rationale":"Checklist item 3: emit the contract, run plan→migrate→verify→sign on a staging copy or `mongodb-memory-server`, confirm `verify` passes against data copied from production shape."},{"id":"_agents_skills_prisma_mongodb_upgrade_references_verify_cutover_checklist_index_parity","label":"Index parity","file_type":"rationale","source_file":"/Users/sadegh/Elajgar/.agents/skills/prisma-mongodb-upgrade/references/verify-cutover-checklist.md","source_location":null,"source_url":null,"captured_at":null,"author":null,"contributor":null,"rationale":"Checklist item 4: enumerate indexes on every collection and confirm the Next contract declares the same set — v6 `db push` may have created indexes the new contract must re-declare."},{"id":"_agents_skills_prisma_mongodb_upgrade_references_verify_cutover_checklist_validator_impact_assessed","label":"Validator impact assessed","file_type":"rationale","source_file":"/Users/sadegh/Elajgar/.agents/skills/prisma-mongodb-upgrade/references/verify-cutover-checklist.md","source_location":null,"source_url":null,"captured_at":null,"author":null,"contributor":null,"rationale":"Checklist item 5: Next emits closed `$jsonSchema` validators by default; confirm legacy documents (extra fields, drifted shapes) pass them on the staging copy before production."},{"id":"_agents_skills_prisma_mongodb_upgrade_references_verify_cutover_checklist_storage_name_addressing","label":"Storage-name addressing","file_type":"rationale","source_file":"/Users/sadegh/Elajgar/.agents/skills/prisma-mongodb-upgrade/references/verify-cutover-checklist.md","source_location":null,"source_url":null,"captured_at":null,"author":null,"contributor":null,"rationale":"Checklist item 6: every ported call site uses collection storage names (`db.orm.users`), not model names."},{"id":"_agents_skills_prisma_mongodb_upgrade_references_verify_cutover_checklist_transaction_inventory_mapped","label":"Transaction inventory mapped","file_type":"rationale","source_file":"/Users/sadegh/Elajgar/.agents/skills/prisma-mongodb-upgrade/references/verify-cutover-checklist.md","source_location":null,"source_url":null,"captured_at":null,"author":null,"contributor":null,"rationale":"Checklist item 7: grep the v6 app for `$transaction`; each hit gets a driver-session equivalent (the `mongodb` driver is directly available; facade wrapper expected soon)."},{"id":"_agents_skills_prisma_mongodb_upgrade_references_verify_cutover_checklist_raw_call_inventory_mapped","label":"Raw call inventory mapped","file_type":"rationale","source_file":"/Users/sadegh/Elajgar/.agents/skills/prisma-mongodb-upgrade/references/verify-cutover-checklist.md","source_location":null,"source_url":null,"captured_at":null,"author":null,"contributor":null,"rationale":"Checklist item 8: every `$runCommandRaw`/`findRaw`/`aggregateRaw` call has an explicit Next-side replacement (`mongoRaw(...)` lane or pipeline builder)."},{"id":"_agents_skills_prisma_mongodb_upgrade_references_verify_cutover_checklist_staged_read_only_soak","label":"Staged read-only soak","file_type":"rationale","source_file":"/Users/sadegh/Elajgar/.agents/skills/prisma-mongodb-upgrade/references/verify-cutover-checklist.md","source_location":null,"source_url":null,"captured_at":null,"author":null,"contributor":null,"rationale":"Checklist item 9: run the Next stack read-only against staging/production data alongside v6 and compare outputs before allowing writes."},{"id":"_agents_skills_prisma_mongodb_upgrade_references_verify_cutover_checklist_cutover_rollback","label":"Cutover and rollback","file_type":"rationale","source_file":"/Users/sadegh/Elajgar/.agents/skills/prisma-mongodb-upgrade/references/verify-cutover-checklist.md","source_location":null,"source_url":null,"captured_at":null,"author":null,"contributor":null,"rationale":"Checklist item 10: switch writes to Next only after the soak; keep the v6 branch deployable as the rollback path; rollback is a code rollback — the data was never moved."},{"id":"_agents_skills_prisma_mongodb_upgrade_references_schema_contract_mapping_v6_datasource_mongodb","label":"v6 MongoDB datasource","file_type":"concept","source_file":"/Users/sadegh/Elajgar/.agents/skills/prisma-mongodb-upgrade/references/schema-contract-mapping.md","source_location":null,"source_url":null,"captured_at":null,"author":null,"contributor":null,"rationale":"v6 `datasource db { provider = \"mongodb\" }` + `url = env(...)`."},{"id":"_agents_skills_prisma_mongodb_upgrade_references_schema_contract_mapping_define_config_mongo","label":"defineConfig @prisma-next/mongo/config","file_type":"concept","source_file":"/Users/sadegh/Elajgar/.agents/skills/prisma-mongodb-upgrade/references/schema-contract-mapping.md","source_location":null,"source_url":null,"captured_at":null,"author":null,"contributor":null,"rationale":"Next selects MongoDB by importing the `@prisma-next/mongo` facade, not by a provider string; `prisma-next init` accepts `mongodb` as a target name."},{"id":"_agents_skills_prisma_mongodb_upgrade_references_schema_contract_mapping_object_id_id_field","label":"ObjectId-typed id field","file_type":"concept","source_file":"/Users/sadegh/Elajgar/.agents/skills/prisma-mongodb-upgrade/references/schema-contract-mapping.md","source_location":null,"source_url":null,"captured_at":null,"author":null,"contributor":null,"rationale":"v6 `@id @default(auto()) @map(\"_id\") @db.ObjectId` → ObjectId-typed id field in the Next contract."},{"id":"_agents_skills_prisma_mongodb_upgrade_references_schema_contract_mapping_composite_types_value_object","label":"Composite types / value objects","file_type":"concept","source_file":"/Users/sadegh/Elajgar/.agents/skills/prisma-mongodb-upgrade/references/schema-contract-mapping.md","source_location":null,"source_url":null,"captured_at":null,"author":null,"contributor":null,"rationale":"v6 composite (embedded) types (MongoDB-only) → value objects / embedded shapes in the Next contract (`valueObject` in the Mongo contract builder); same conceptual role: documents embedded in a parent document."},{"id":"_agents_skills_prisma_mongodb_upgrade_references_schema_contract_mapping_model_names_vs_storage_names","label":"Model names vs collection storage names","file_type":"rationale","source_file":"/Users/sadegh/Elajgar/.agents/skills/prisma-mongodb-upgrade/references/schema-contract-mapping.md","source_location":null,"source_url":null,"captured_at":null,"author":null,"contributor":null,"rationale":"v6 model names address the client (`prisma.user`) → Next collection storage names address the ORM (`db.orm.users`, the `@@map` name or lowercased model name, not `db.orm.User`); the most common porting mistake."},{"id":"_agents_skills_prisma_mongodb_upgrade_references_schema_contract_mapping_indexes_contract_declared","label":"Indexes contract-declared","file_type":"rationale","source_file":"/Users/sadegh/Elajgar/.agents/skills/prisma-mongodb-upgrade/references/schema-contract-mapping.md","source_location":null,"source_url":null,"captured_at":null,"author":null,"contributor":null,"rationale":"v6 indexes declared in schema applied by `db push` → Next indexes contract-declared and applied through migrations (`createIndex`/`dropIndex` factories)."},{"id":"_agents_skills_prisma_mongodb_upgrade_references_schema_contract_mapping_n